// AyuLink host test runner — protocol v2, downlink queue, fall detector.
//
// Compiled with g++ on the host and run with firmware/test/run_tests.sh.
// The SAME headers are compiled into the ESP32 firmware, so a protocol or
// state-machine bug fails here rather than on a patient.
//
//   g++ -std=c++14 -O2 -I../common test_firmware.cpp -lcrypto -o /tmp/t && /tmp/t
//
// Honesty note on the fall harness (Phase 7):
//   The confusion matrix printed at the end is measured against SYNTHETIC
//   accelerometer traces generated by this file. It measures the STATE MACHINE,
//   not human physiology. It is NOT clinical validation and must never be
//   quoted as a device accuracy figure. See docs/VALIDATION.md.

